flowchart LR
    Human[Human] -->|signals| Sense[Sense]
    Sense -->|raw + availability| Preserve[Preserve]
    Preserve -->|lawful window| Infer[Infer: input cutoff]
    Infer -->|evaluate| Decide[Decide + Quality Gates]
    Decide -->|command| Intervene[Intervene]
    Intervene -->|cue| Human
    Intervene -->|IMU observes actuation| Sense
    Preserve --> Verify[Verify: replay, temporal check, execution chain]

    Sensors[Sensors] --> Capture[Deterministic Capture]
    Capture --> SRAM[SRAM Ring]
    SRAM --> PSRAM[PSRAM Spill]
    PSRAM --> SD[microSD]
    Capture --> RecordAssembly[Record Assembly]
    RecordAssembly --> Telemetry[BLE / Wi-Fi / USB Telemetry]
    DeviceClock[Authoritative Device Monotonic Clock] --> Capture
    DeviceClock --> Intervene
    DeviceClock --> RecordAssembly
    RecordAssembly --> Evidence[Raw + Timing + Sequence + Quality + Provenance Evidence]
